    "body": "@annevk I think he's just referring to the three specs in the [OP](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/6211#issue-761510623) and their needs. Maybe \"foreground\" is the wrong word, but so was \"visible and focused\" when applied to the document or its viewport. In layterms I think all three were trying to say \"visible and focused\" applied to the _browser window_, but we don't know what to call that in specs. ",
