    "updated_at": "2021-12-17T23:08:55Z",
    "body": "I'm renaming this issue from \"foreground detection\" to \"browser window has focus\" which is the part not covered by https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/7238.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure we'll be able to reconcile differences between desktop and mobile for all specs, so it may be up to individual specs whether they want a browser focus requirement, a browser visibility requirement or both.",
