    "created_at": "2021-12-17T23:08:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-12-17T23:08:59Z",
    "body": "How about something like:\r\n\r\n_\"A top-level browsing context has **proximate system focus** when it has [system focus](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#tlbc-system-focus) or when user agent widgets directly related to it can receive keyboard input channeled from the operating system._\r\n\r\n_**Note:** Proximate system focus is lost when a browser window loses focus.\"_",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
